%N A400225 G.f.: 1 = Sum_{n>=0} a(n) * x^n / (1 + 2^n*x)^(2^n).
%F A400225 a(0) = 1; a(n) = Sum_{k=0..n-1} (-1)^(n-k-1) * binomial(2^k+n-k-1,n-k) * 2^(k*(n-k)) * a(k).
%F A400225 a(n) ~ c * d^n * 2^(n^2), where d = 0.4289008446588321572728600798084742085554031544797444512391247518... and c = 0.8188969455671886912218915150433282180692091373204013126314077674... - _Vaclav Kotesovec_, Sep 22 2026
%t A400225 a[0] = 1; a[n_] := a[n] = Sum[(-1)^(n - k - 1) Binomial[2^k + n - k - 1, n - k] 2^(k (n - k)) a[k], {k, 0, n - 1}]; Table[a[n], {n, 0, 14}]
